WEBVTT

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:02.010
I've been working with Tayyab for a little bit

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:03.040
over a year now, and he's helped me grow my

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.340
audience over 50,000 new members.

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:07.180
And that's across short form, like TikTok,

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.300
Instagram, and Reels, and long form, like my

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.180
YouTube channel, which I spend so much time

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:11.340
on.

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.240
And I like working with this editor because

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.700
he's just simply so amazing.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:16.940
Of course that editing, that's a given, but

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:19.370
he's better than that because he can really

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:21.990
take in constructive feedback and then implement

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:24.300
that feedback perfectly, oftentimes going above

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.280
and beyond the vision that I had in the first

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:28.460
place, because he has a great eye for content

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:29.980
and a great eye for storytelling.

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:32.010
So if you have the opportunity, the chance

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:33.840
to work with this editor, take it.
